From ca7bed0f3c87bb45621b325698e157d865816140 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sirherobrine23 <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 12:38:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 131/162] net: omci: add OLT interoperability profiles

Add generic, automatic and vendor-specific OLT profiles to the OMCI
agent. Keep the generic policy selected by default and allow userspace
to configure or force a concrete profile through Generic Netlink.

Resolve automatic profiles from OLT-G identification data, publish the
effective policy and quirk bitmap, and notify the hardware backend when
the policy changes. Extend the unified Airoha xPON backend with a
profile callback and retain the resolved state for driver-specific
handling.

Signed-off-by: Sirherobrine23 <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
